records.solution:
Since $\sin E = 1$, we have $\angle E = 90^\circ$, so our triangle is as shown below:

[asy]
pair D,EE,F;

EE = (0,0);
F = (5,0);
D = (0,12);
draw(D--EE--F--D);
draw(rightanglemark(F,EE,D,18));
